        "Next steps:",
        "",
        "1. Install the adapter:",
        "   npm install -D svelte-kit-sst@npm:@sst-community/svelte-kit-sst",
        "",
        "2. Use it in vite.config.ts (SvelteKit 3), or in svelte.config.js (SvelteKit 2):",
        "   import adapter from \"svelte-kit-sst\";",
        "   sveltekit({ adapter: adapter() })"
      ]
    }
